|---|---|
| `consult-the-orchestrator.md` | When to consult, how to send, four-signal replies, human hop |
| `executor-consult-block.md` | Paste parts for every executor spawn ticket |
| `host-detect.md` | Claude / Codex / ThirdParty detect for worker-model routing |
